==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Skorupi|38}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

